\(\theta_{0}(1)\!=\!2\) sinh \(1\!=\!2.350402\) and again carrying 9D, we obtain column (1). The underlined figures are in error. The above shows that three significant figures are lost in forward recurrence, whereas about three significant figures are gained in backward recurrence!

